rows.fix:
In course/assets/css/course.css replace the rule
  .chart .area {
    fill: currentColor;
    fill-opacity: 0.18;
    stroke: none;
  }
with
  .chart .area {
    fill: currentColor;
    fill-opacity: 0.18;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
The outline takes the series colour: 5.75:1 against #ffffff and 8.61:1 against #161a20 (4.38:1 and 6.04:1 against the fill composite), so the DSR region has a 3:1 boundary in both themes; the legend swatch (same class) gets the same outline. The rule applies to every area layer of every figure, so after the change re-run .venv/bin/python tools/page_smoke.py --unit S7 --pages L07 L08 and every other unit that draws areas, and re-run the figure driver (scratch scripts/drive_figures.py) to confirm the readouts are unchanged.
